WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
AgentHazard: evaluate harmful behavior across multi-step agent trajectories.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
VERA: discover risks, execute safety cases, and verify observable evidence.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
BraveGuard, HazardAuditor, and AdaGuard explore complementary defense directions.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
